169
00:08:03,399 --> 00:08:06,777
Oh, excuse me,
are you guys League players for T1?

170
00:08:07,278 --> 00:08:08,654
Oh, yes, yes, we are.

171
00:08:08,738 --> 00:08:11,365
Oh, yes, yes, we are.

172
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:13,284
Holy crap!

173
00:08:14,118 --> 00:08:15,203
