-The entire head.

250
00:12:08,227 --> 00:12:10,146
-You hurt?
-I know, I should have.

251
00:12:10,229 --> 00:12:12,440
-He's upset about the snowman's head.
-It fell off.

252
00:12:14,024 --> 00:12:16,193
Just got really obsessed with it.

253
00:12:16,277 --> 00:12:18,237
READING THE ROOM

254
00:12:18,821 --> 00:12:20,573
